# NOTE: genome paths use ${FOCUS_DB}/db/ (RaPDTool type-material set; set in config.sh).
# Benchmark mock community — 20 type-material genomes (10 reference + 10 conflictive)
# Selected with check_representation.py (--sample 1500 --seed 42) against
#   Kraken2 standard/16/8 inspect.txt  and  MetaPhlAn vJan26_CHOCOPhlAnSGB .pkl
# GCA per taxid resolved authoritatively from acc_taxid_strain.tsv. ~15 phyla total.
# Feed to: ./make_mock.sh -o mock -t 16 -l mock_genomes.list   (mock lives inside the kit)
#
# --- REFERENCE, 5 clinical (present in Kraken full/16/8 AND MetaPhlAn) ---
